	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Your constant experimentation and testing of your limits has begun to expand them. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Constitution, Intelligence, or Charisma score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain an expertise die to your Arcana skill. Your maximum expertise die size for Arcana increases to a d10.</p></li><li><p>You learn a 1st- or 2nd- level spell from the bard, sorcerer, or wizard list. It counts as a sorcerer spell for you, and does not count against your spells known.</p></li><li><p>You learn a second @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.h2tobazibq72ybdo]{Manifestation} option.</p></li></ul>",
